+"""Native voice seam: the usable multi-chunk join (Task4 B) for remote and local routes.
+
+REAL: the pinned OpenAI SDK + httpx (synthetic bytes only), the real runner / process group / pipes, the real ``ffmpeg`` for
+conversion AND concat, and real MP3 chunks. HARNESS, stated plainly: the qualified network-deny launcher is replaced by a
+hashed stand-in (``native_command_fixtures/launcher_passthrough.py``, NOT a sandbox) and, where a test needs a stall or a
+concat that fails, by ``launcher_faulty.py`` (labelled stand-in); the local engine is the protocol stand-in
+``engine_fixture.py`` (NOT an engine). None of this is sandbox, engine or audio-quality proof.
+"""
