+These close the controls the scoped review left for the next native-probe touch: a HELD ffprobe at the concat preflight (zero sends) and
+after payment (provider completed) under Stop and the deadline, an ffprobe that disappears after the last paid chunk, and the exact
+positive remainder (no expired spawn) of ``_count_packets`` together with the NEW preparation and Gemini conversion helpers.
+
+REAL: the pinned OpenAI SDK + httpx (synthetic bytes only), the real runner and the NEW owned approved ffmpeg/ffprobe on real MP3 chunks.
+HARNESS: the qualified network-deny launcher is a hashed stand-in (NOT a sandbox); ``hold-ffprobe-N`` holds the N-th ffprobe child (the
+concat preflight counts 3 packet sets, so the 4th is the first count after the paid chunks were joined). Source coverage only: not
+wall-clock, platform or sandbox acceptance.
