+    """Task4 B (the EXISTING real-stack test, assessed and strengthened in place, not duplicated): the full text above 600
+    code points reaches the real Edge stack as one gated
+    handshake per chunk, every word in order (no truncation or substitution), and the REAL launcher-wrapped ffmpeg joins
+    real MP3 chunks into one valid file. The service is a synthetic socket, not a live Edge service."""
