+"""Native voice seam: configured speech-to-text sent once, truthful outcomes, no leaks.
+
+Real OpenAI SDK, real httpx client and real ``requests`` session over a synthetic network transport
+(``native_voice_support``); the profile's STT configuration is the real ``config.yaml`` read at call
+time. Counts below are requests that reached the transport. The stock-path counterparts (2 and 4
+requests for the same failures) are recorded in ``tests/tools/test_native_voice_stock_transport.py``.
+"""
